* Davranissal modeller (ideal degil, odev simulasyonu icin)

* NE555: pinler vcc gnd trig thr cv dis out
.subckt NE555 vcc gnd trig thr cv dis out
R1 vcc cv 5k
R2 cv n2 5k
R3 n2 gnd 5k
Bq qraw gnd V = (v(trig,gnd) < v(n2,gnd)) ? 1 : ((v(thr,gnd) > v(cv,gnd)) ? 0 : (v(qd,gnd) > 0.5 ? 1 : 0))
Rq qraw qd 1k
Cq qd gnd 1p
Bo o1 gnd V = v(qd,gnd) > 0.5 ? v(vcc,gnd)-1.7 : 0.1
Ro o1 out 10
Bd dis gnd I = v(qd,gnd) < 0.5 ? v(dis,gnd)/20 : 0
.ends

* TL071: A0=100 dB, GBW=3 MHz, egim 13 V/us, cikis raylardan ~1,5 V iceride
.subckt TL071 inp inn vcc vee out
Cin inp inn 3p
Bm mid 0 V = (v(vcc)+v(vee))/2
Bg mid b I = max(min(1*v(inp,inn), 0.7m), -0.7m)
Rb b mid 100k
Cb b mid 53n
Bh hi 0 V = v(vcc)-0.9
Bl lo 0 V = v(vee)+0.9
Dh b hi DCLAMP
Dl lo b DCLAMP
.model DCLAMP D(Is=1e-14 N=1)
Eo out 0 b 0 1
.ends

* LM386: kazanc 200 (pin 1-8 arasi 10uF), cikis Vcc/2 etrafinda, 50k giris direnci
.subckt LM386 inp inn vcc gnd out
Ri1 inp gnd 50k
Ri2 inn gnd 50k
Ba a gnd V = max(min(v(vcc,gnd)/2 + 200*v(inp,inn), v(vcc,gnd)-0.7), 0.7)
Rp a b 1
Cp b gnd 530n
Ro b out 0.5
.ends
